# AI-6D — Director Proposal Runtime

Implement the first real Director editing vertical slice in AGNES.

The goal of this phase is **not** to add more Agent UI, autonomous planning, or production automation.

The goal is to turn the existing Director from a context-aware chat agent into a Director that can produce a **real, structured, reviewable storyboard proposal** which is safely previewed and applied only inside a Creative Workspace.

The complete vertical slice should become:

```text
Storyboard context
        ↓
Director
        ↓
storyboard.propose_change
        ↓
Agnes reasoning
        ↓
semantic storyboard intentions
        ↓
deterministic compiler
        ↓
existing AI-6A ChangeOperation[]
        ↓
Director Creative Workspace
        ↓
ChangeSet Preview
        ↓
Validation / Diff / Impact / Warnings
        ↓
Storyboard inline Proposal UI
        ↓
user selects changes
        ↓
preview selected subset again
        ↓
apply the new ChangeSet
        ↓
Workspace changes
        ↓
canonical project remains unchanged
```

Stop when this vertical slice is genuinely working.

Do not continue into Production Planner, Shot Producer, Reviewer, autonomous Producer, Workspace Production, recursive delegation, or other Agent capabilities.

