The existing reserved capability:

```text
storyboard.propose_change
```

should become a real Director capability.

Keep the existing Capability Registry and permission checks.

Do not bypass Agent permissions just because the frontend calls a Director-specific endpoint.

The capability should be owned/allowed according to the existing registry policy and should remain unavailable to agents that are not authorized.

Do not create a second Director runtime.

Reuse the existing:

* Agent Registry
* ModelProfile resolution
* Agent context system
* Agnes client
* Agent permissions
* project resolution

