# 18. Frontend: connect the real Proposal

AI-6C already created the UI boundary.

Replace:

```text
currentProposal = null forever
```

with real Proposal state loaded from the backend.

When a real Director proposal completes:

* populate `DirectorProposalOverlay`
* render INSERT / UPDATE / DELETE / REORDER in the existing Storyboard proposal components
* derive KEEP visually
* show real diff/impact/warnings
* allow selection by proposal item
* allow previewing the selected subset
* apply only the newly previewed selected ChangeSet

Do not rebuild the Storyboard UI.

Do not create a Director sidebar.

Do not create another chat interface.

