# 19. Conversation and Proposal remain different actions

Do not make every Director chat message automatically create a Proposal.

Preserve two modes:

### Discussion

```text
Ask Director
Analyse shot
```

→ normal Agent Conversation.

### Modification intent

```text
Improve pacing
Redesign
Adjust composition
```

→ user can explicitly choose:

```text
Generate modification proposal
```

→ `storyboard.propose_change`

Also allow a normal Director conversation to expose a restrained:

```text
Generate storyboard proposal
```

action using the current conversation/request as the instruction.

But Proposal creation must always be explicit.

Conversation messages are not Proposal objects.

Do not parse Markdown chat messages to discover hidden ChangeOperations.

