# 20. After Apply

After the selected ChangeSet is successfully applied:

Do not mutate canonical Storyboard.

Show a clear state such as:

```text
Applied to creative version

The official storyboard has not changed.

[Open creative version]
[Continue viewing official storyboard]
```

“Open creative version” should use the existing Creative Workspace Studio / Workspace route.

Do not make ShotBoard source-aware in AI-6D.

That comes later.

---

# 21. Canonical protection

At the end of the complete Director flow:

```text
projects/<project>/output/project.json
```

must be byte-for-byte / signature-equivalent to its state before the Proposal operation, except for unrelated external user actions.

The Director is allowed to change only:

```text
Director Workspace working project
```

through the existing ChangeSet Apply mechanism.

No Agent code may directly mutate canonical ProjectStore data.

This is the defining invariant of AI-6D.

